; The ONE variable: `layout_direction = 3` (RTL). `Control::is_layout_rtl`
; resolves an explicit RTL with no locale and no TextServer lookup, and
; `BoxContainer::_resort` reads it (box_container.cpp:48) to lay its children
; out from the opposite edge. The three bars have different widths so a
; reversal cannot be mistaken for a mirror of equal blocks, and the LTR row
; above holds the unmirrored order beside it.

